  "body": "## What changed\n\nUpdate eleven guide pages for the changes merged after #1802.\nCover EDM, 2D and 3D operations, stock carry, threading, posting and STEP import.\nUse the guide structure from #1908.\nThe audit covers all 48 later PRs through upstream/main cda3d589.\nEach entry names its guide coverage or gives a reason that no further documentation is needed.\nThe full audit is [on the issue](https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/1939#issuecomment-6900408119).\nAlso cover the earlier Trochoidal parallel-lane gap from #1788.\nRecord choices in docs/decisions/1939-guide-review.md.\n\n## Cause\n\nUser-visible changes landed after the previous guide review.\nThe guide still claimed that no wire EDM machine shipped and that sinker electrodes were rectangular only.\nIt omitted new controls, workflows and refusal remedies.\n\n## Tests\n\nAdd eight pins in site/tests/test_release_022_guide.py:\n\n- test_shipped_sodick_machine_replaces_no_wire_machine_claim\n- test_body_electrode_workflow_replaces_rectangular_only_description\n- test_explain_gcode_names_supported_posts_and_unchanged_words\n- test_trochoidal_controls_are_in_adaptive_section\n- test_bore_explains_wide_hole_rings_and_blind_floor\n- test_stock_carry_names_side_on_turn_and_retained_gouges\n- test_aligned_3d_operations_and_area_controls_are_documented\n- test_incomplete_step_shell_and_subdivision_refusals_have_remedies\n\nAll eight failed before the guide changes and pass afterward.\nMutation checks restored each upstream page separately: 2D, 3D, EDM, posting, machines, refusals and setups.\nEach old page made the pins fail.\nEach restored page made them pass.\nAll 16 site tests pass, including built internal links, anchors, aliases and operation pictures.\nZola 0.23.6 builds 42 pages and 10 sections without broken internal links.\nThe command cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main passes with zero Rust steps selected.\nClippy does not apply because no Rust crate changed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\nThe diff for *.nc and *.cl is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo GUI session or machine-control run was performed.\nNo Rust runtime behavior changed.\nSodick 4-axis and flushing work in #1497 and #1499 remains unshipped.\nThe next cut must file the v0.23.0 guide review.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPR #1920 touches machines.md in the Router section.\nThis PR changes the EDM table and section.\nIt touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nPR #1921 touches operations-edm.md after the 4-axis profiles paragraph.\nThis PR changes machine, taper, Sodick and sinker sections.\nIt touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\nNo stacking is needed.\n\nChangelog: none (documentation only)\n\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #1939\n",
